From 133e056f51173879546cbd2397783f7f48fa8ba1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:20:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 25/63] libroot/arm: fenv, system_time(), byte swapping and a
 faster memcpy()

- implement fenv on top of the VFP FPSCR
- get system_time() from the kernel
- fix __swap_float() and __swap_double() for the hard-float ABI
- memcpy() and memset() in assembly; merge aligned words when the
  memcpy() source is misaligned; the AEABI memcpy entry points

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
